{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5c8e3e7e36ff0b41ec0c9ddf1fcc594844bdf29652220e42a4d5f0bd7d71e12c","ja":"面倒見のいいお姉さん","zh":"会照顾人的姐姐","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b760fab30e6cde7d385f90f539e2718007afb9ab8af1f4bf67d98b064ed91957","ja":"たまき、お仕事すっごくがんばったぞ！\n楽しかったね！","zh":"环工作超级努力哦！\n真开心呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d24e34856e390ca594ff9dea4b6a040f2806517139080d7a21ec6a93d40457aa","ja":"うん、みんなバッチリだったよね……あれっ？","zh":"嗯，大家都表现得很完美呢……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b4519fb9eefee13088b66d557ef553ce85fe6f3cda08dd73782512bea2e0a107","ja":"あそこのおばあさん、きょろきょろしてるね。\nどうしたのかな？","zh":"那边的老婆婆一直在东张西望呢。\n怎么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c59df0056f9171844f2477bb3d79e1b777c7359fe7f7af16aee27d54eef3fa87","ja":"こんにちは！　何か困ってるの？\nそれなら、自分たちがお手伝いするぞ！","zh":"你好！遇到什么困难了吗？\n那样的话，就由我们来帮忙吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"7670ca7fb3fd3eda2ddef1331b1a50276bce9e231096d0a4870b925087108674","ja":"「あら。ええと……乗る電車がわからなくてね。\nここに行きたいのだけれど」","zh":"「哎呀。那个……我不知道该坐哪趟电车。\n我想去这里……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7e20ef5ff71bf7efa337ba26508881acac04357d9768fa8e1e379eebc5fa7bf5","ja":"あっ、たまき、そこ遠足で行ったことあるぞ！\n青色の電車に乗ったんだ！","zh":"啊，环去那里远足过哦！\n还坐了蓝色的电车呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f2319ba8cbf23e239d0b025da31229e777116da322156cb6e9fd1cf9d64b4134","ja":"わたしも知ってる！　えっと、右側の……\n2番線の電車に乗ったら大丈夫だよ。","zh":"我也知道！那个，只要坐右边……\n2号站台的电车就没问题了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"21886f5cf624299f4186e1aa65d2947057b9555732417cba086461b1eb847322","ja":"「ありがとう、みんないい子ね。しっかりしている\n妹さんたちがいて、お姉さんも鼻が高いでしょう？」","zh":"「谢谢你们，都是好孩子呢。有这么懂事的\n妹妹们，做姐姐的肯定也很自豪吧？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"948be43aa9041f1e9ceb59741260ea89b9079ebf18b4116e4572dc6b88fba699","ja":"えっ、お姉さんって……じ、自分のこと！？","zh":"欸，大姐姐是指……我、我自己吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"4c2a51749cc2d50e7e67c103e9ccf192e7496ef35060c0cc4eac9582006bad30","ja":"「妹さんたちも、面倒見のいいお姉さんがいて\nよかったわねぇ。これからも仲良くするのよ？」","zh":"“妹妹们有你这么个会照顾人的好姐姐，\n真是太好了呢。今后也要好好相处哦？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"cd38104f787c6c1ff1715a69b58f00bbe587b5d7218d27e3edbbcebec2a6d86e","ja":"うんっ。おばあさんも気を付けてね。","zh":"嗯。老奶奶您也要当心哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"b0926ed59943d967008d49b3c48e1104a2a443a9691ff1b335719fdcfae22f3a","ja":"じゃあね～。いってらっしゃ～い！","zh":"再见啦～。路上小心～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"23bdf56f069eeeb6ff0c12ee07aaee4b08b893076b90d698a704d54c18235e30","ja":"（面倒見のいいお姉さん、か……えへへ。確かに、\n自分が一番年上だし、しっかりしないとだよね！）","zh":"（很会照顾人的大姐姐啊……嘿嘿。确实，\n我是年纪最大的一个，必须得好好振作起来才行呢！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"f69a5653637cfc59c3e42cfa7093427a73b56386c42684e8644731e697c5dbf7","ja":"環、育、お腹すいたでしょ？\n自分が、オシャレなカフェに連れて行ってあげるぞ！","zh":"环、育，肚子饿了吧？\n我带你们去时髦的咖啡厅吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"2366afb26afa15e96f10ced3a491e2972eb3c678cfc7e47a2dc7de6ff1b173ce","ja":"わあ……いいの？\nオシャレで、大人なカフェ？","zh":"哇……真的可以吗？\n是很时尚、很有成熟气息的咖啡厅？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"0b19edea3d72dc7d5807e4832a7089bd4daaefd1c8ac9d84bc8d3d08e8e5963d","ja":"うん、とびっきりの場所だぞ。\nあと自分はお姉さんだから、おごってあげるからね！","zh":"嗯，是个绝佳的好地方哦。\n而且我可是大姐姐，这顿就由我来请客吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1753.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"987ec3c4a76e02a5131da68cc8724e9f5f28b962385cd0e73c0f7ae5d884d375","ja":"やった～！　ありがと～！","zh":"太好啦～！谢谢啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
